<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"> * </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">@note</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;">   使用DAC1_CH1和DAC1_CH2输出两个变量</span></span>
